{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21265","headline":"和东川李相公慈竹十二韵 · 元稹","name":"和东川李相公慈竹十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慈竹不外长，密比青瑶华。\n矛攒有森束，玉粒无蹉跎。\n纤粉妍腻质，细琼交翠柯。\n亭亭霄汉近，霭霭雨露多。\n冰碧寒夜耸，箫韶风昼罗。\n烟含胧胧影，月泛鳞鳞波。\n鸾凤一已顾，燕雀永不过。\n幽姿媚庭实，颢气爽天涯。\n峻节高转露，贞筠寒更佳。\n托身仙坛上，灵物神所呵。\n时与天籁合，日闻阳春歌。\n应怜孤生者，摧折成病痾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}